's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","review_id":"qZUvZHb----43lNHCxCaXw","date":"2014-02-24T17:46:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.946624755859375,"text_excerpt":"Though I rarely visit R Bar, I really like it when I do! And it's 99.99% because of the people I meet/see there. I know it's been described as divey, but to me, a divey bar has old grizzled men that sit at the bar drinking their $2 PBR with their cigarette and only talk to the bartender. This place has always been busy on the nights I go, but the bar is still reachable. They have a good variety of beers from PBR to Pacifico. Though they aren't $2, it's worth it to hang out with the people that visit this bar. I \"tipped\" that on Mondays you can get a haircut, beer, and shot in the barber chair but it's a haircut and a shot. I was told this by Kerry, a regular, who was so sweet and chatted ..."},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","review_id":"y24hOqRCY8OcILBZ3yUv3A","date":"2008-01-19T22:55:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.939262866973877,"text_excerpt":"I've never stayed at the Inn, but the R Bar is one of my very favorite bars in New Orleans. Low key, very local feel, and very welcoming. Pool table, excellent juke box, nice folks. Larger pours at better prices than many others as well. Lots of places to lounge. Special caveat: Not recommended if you're looking for someplace to get loud and naked. And if you are, *please* do that in Kansas or North Dakota or Fresno or somewhere else that really needs some loudness and nakedness and people in bad sunglasses and shedding feather boas. New Orleans has plenty of that already! Anyway, digression aside, this bar gets all the stars."},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","review_id":"oo-7cHRW9KQnsMP17B6qgg","date":"2011-09-30T16:03:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9341379404067993,"text_excerpt":"I really like the R Bar. Super friendly bartenders and really great crowd most of the time. Very laid-back atmosphere. Definitely one of the cooler bars I have been to lately. Lots of locals here, great area of the city, and the only place I know of where you check-in/out for the inn with the bartender."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","photo_id":"TJy7pGtd8HaMotGTnsVGYg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/TJy7pGtd8HaMotGTnsVGYg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8618589639663696},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","photo_id":"Icrnptw74lllWi-KDgoiow","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Icrnptw74lllWi-KDgoiow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8449876308441162},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","photo_id":"9vuJIUAxax2UflvdYSSujg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/9vuJIUAxax2UflvdYSSujg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8231638669967651},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","photo_id":"uSVKkZwrfZyUmo8PUwLlRQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uSVKkZwrfZyUmo8PUwLlRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7805398106575012},{"business_id":"f64wvgLjQZEhSck9iYptSw","photo_id":"M3KdwbJi8qdXrZdwqTLzuw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/M3KdwbJi8qdXrZ